"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5216720","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4237670-1847286114037505","game_id":"steam-4237670","kind":"announcement","title":"There's no AI in Submind!","summary":"With more and more people showing up on our socials in order to know the game better, it was a matter of time until somebody asked: \"Did you use AI in this game?\" The short answer is: No, there's not any kind of AI in Submind. But we feel the need to give a long answer as well. So far, this Steam Next Fest has been amazing for us, Recently, we got over 300 wishlists and it keeps going up every day! And as gamers, everyone on the team downloaded a bunch of demos to check them out as well, but aft","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:15:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037505","verified_at":"2026-10-23T23:32:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4237670-1847286114034026","game_id":"steam-4237670","kind":"announcement","title":"We surpassed 300 wishlists!","summary":"Greetings, Operators. Today, Submind surpassed 300 wishlists!Once again, we're happy that so many of you are taking interest in our game! We're very grateful for your support!And, don't forget that you can follow our socials to stay in touch with our current and future plans. We have some people on our Discord now as well! (Links at the bottom of this announcement)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T19:55:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034026","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:28:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4237670-1846018067943634","game_id":"steam-4237670","kind":"announcement","title":"We surpassed 100 wishlists!","summary":"Operators, Submind surpassed 100 wishlists! We're glad that so many of you are taking interest in our game, and we're very grateful for your support! Don't forget that you can follow our socials to stay in touch with our current and future plans (Links at the bottom of this announcement)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T10:44:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943634","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4237670-1844115010503350","game_id":"steam-4237670","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay Trailer released + Demo on October 8th!","summary":"Greetings, operators! With Steam Next Fest rapidly approaching (less than a month now!), we wanted to give you the chance to test our game ahead of the event! Starting October 8th, the demo will be available for everyone to play all the way until the end of Next Fest on October 26th! And if you do give it a try, everyone on the team would absolutely love to hear what you think. The good, the bad, and everything in between. Your feedback will help us improve the game, so don't hold back! Bring yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T06:59:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503350","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4237670-1842846814446346","game_id":"steam-4237670","kind":"announcement","title":"Submind - Official Announcement","summary":"Dear Operators!It’s finally happening.What we have been working on for the past 8 months is finally becoming a reality. We can proudly announce our PC game Submind, which will be presented at Steam Next Fest.Submind is not your usual clichéd co-op horror game. It’s a horror game without jumpscares (the Game Director doesn’t like them). We were inspired by the visual style of Tim Burton and tried to bring some of that feeling into our game. Everything you see in the game is there intentionally.In","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T12:34:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4237670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4237670":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4237670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z"},"5216720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:13Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4237670","app_id":4237670,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"4dc9cdcd8b0d56d055d7725a111694054ecbdab188abec18e8182cb4ee428784","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"최대 3명의 친구와 함께 붕괴된 정신 속으로 뛰어들어 환자의 정신을 안정시키세요. 올바른 길을 선택하고, 퍼즐을 풀고, 주변을 주의 깊게 살피세요. 하지만 무엇보다 환자의 정신이 돌이킬 수 없는 지점에 도달하지 않도록 해야 합니다. 그렇지 않으면 그들의 가장 끔찍한 트라우마와 악몽을 직접 마주하게 될 것입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Inoutbox","creator_clan_account_id":46056850}],"developers":[{"name":"Inoutbox","creator_clan_acco